stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> READY
    READY --> MATCHING: startMatching()
    MATCHING --> MATCHED: setResult(match)\ninside onMatching()
    MATCHED --> TERMINATED: leaveMatch() / endMatch()
    MATCHING --> TERMINATED: leaveMatch()\n(cancelled before a match was found)
    READY --> TERMINATED: leaveMatch()\n(cancelled before matching started)
    TERMINATED --> TERMINATED: any further call is a no-op

    note right of TERMINATED
        Absorbing. A handle can never
        come back to life once terminated.
    end note
